<h2>Installation and Setup</h2>
<p>The harness is distributed in the form of a <strong>Claude Code plugin</strong>. Once you register the marketplace and install it, you can use the <code>/harness</code> command.</p>

<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">What you need first</span>
    <strong>Claude Code must be installed</strong> (see <a href="#!welcome">Getting Started</a>). In the terminal, move to the project folder you will work in, run <code>claude</code>, and then enter the slash commands below.
</div>

